    "agent_last_message": "Implemented the complete CLI at [output/main.js](/workspace/output/main.js).\n\nWhat it does:\n- Parses `--input` and `--output` (also supports `--input=...` / `--output=...`).\n- Rejects unknown/missing/duplicate args with exit code `1`.\n- Reads and analyzes the input file using only Node.js standard library.\n- Counts:\n  - `lines` per spec (`\\n`-terminated lines, with proper last-line handling)\n  - `words` using whitespace set: space, tab, newline, carriage return, form feed, vertical tab\n  - `characters` as raw byte count\n  - `unique_words` case-insensitively\n  - `top_words` (up to 10), sorted by count desc then word asc\n- Writes JSON output in the required schema.\n- Exit codes:\n  - `0` success\n  - `1` invalid invocation/input unreadable or malformed UTF-8\n  - `2` unexpected internal errors (e.g., output write failure)\n\nValidation completed with spec edge cases (empty file, whitespace-only, trailing/no trailing newline, consecutive newlines, punctuation, case folding, sorting/tie-breaks, and error paths).",
